<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">OCR · 云识别</text>
    <text class="title">拍图识字</text>
    <text class="desc">拍照或选图后上传到云函数识别。若 OCR 服务未配置，会明确提示，不展示模拟结果。</text>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="chooseImage">选择或拍照</button>
  </view>

  <view class="panel" wx:if="{{imagePath}}">
    <image class="preview" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="row">
      <text>待识别图片</text>
      <text>{{sizeLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <button class="primary full" bindtap="recognizeImage" loading="{{isProcessing}}" disabled="{{isProcessing}}">
      开始识别
    </button>
    <text class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <text class="section-title">隐私提示</text>
    <text class="muted">票据、合同、证件可能包含个人信息。OCR 会短期上传处理，后续需在云端配置自动删除策略。</text>
  </view>
</view>
